A||||8||SwissFormula||My '68 GTO - some sad PICS||||9||
Z||000000||SwissFormula||11-17-2001||08:51 AM||||hello DXR_DAD and all the other muscle-car fans! this are pics of my '68 PONTIAC GTO. Its red with black venyl roof & black interior, ohh, it used to be  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Has the "standard" 400ci engine (350 BHP) and a TH350 auto.<P>The paint does not look that good as it seems to be in the pictures, there is rust everywhere, so i decided to completely strip the old paint and do a serious rebuild. The old venyl roof, hood, front bumper & interior stuff has been removed, that was how we started:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.darklord.ch/images/pontiac/68gto_before.jpg"> <P>Thats how the car looked 2 month ago, most of the old pain is gone:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.darklord.ch/images/pontiac/68gto.jpg"> <P>Interior view:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.darklord.ch/images/pontiac/68gto_interior.jpg"> <P>I have a new carpet, new venyl roof and will also replace some of the trim & rubber parts. It will look like new and 100% stock when finished...oh...yes, the rims are not!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Well, there is one thing i am missing, the optional hood tach! My car has NO OPTIONS: no A/C, no tach, no clock, no oil pressure & temp gage, nothing!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> i'm lucky to have powersteering & the hurst dual shifter...<BR>So if one has a friend that knows a guy who's bro has an old GTO hood-tach he does not need, ME WANT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Ohh, maybe you wont believe, but <B>yessir! i am the second owner!</B> This guy bought it 7 years before i was born... wooh, what an old car...<P>have some engine pics after it has been taken out & painted, and some pics of what we found under the paint... wanna see?<P>und tschüss<BR>Roy<P>------------------<BR>88 Formula, T-Top<BR>1 of 20 Fieros in Switzerland||||reg||9
Z||000001||Jake_Dragon||11-17-2001||08:59 AM||||Sad??<P>That car rocks!<P>Cant wait to see what you do with it.||||reg||1
